      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-188"
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0213#4",
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 188",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0213#5",
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 189",
      "box": [
        879,
        671,
        192,
        392
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-189"
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0213#6",
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 189",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0213#7",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在观察细小物体时增大视角的最简单的方法是利用**放大",
        "镜**. 会聚透镜或者焦距 $F$ 小的（一般不超过 $10$ 厘米）的透",
        "镜组叫做**放大镜**. 通常把放大镜移得靠近眼睛，而物体放在",
        "它的焦平面上. 这样，物体上的任何点发出的光线从放大镜",
        "发射出来以后形成平行的光束（图 189）. 因此，在视网膜上",
        "得到了点的清楚的像，而眼睛不紧张. 从放大镜中看到物体",
        "的视角",
        "$\\varphi_1=\\frac{h}{F}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0213#8",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求出放大镜的角放大率，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0213#9",
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "· 203 ·"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0214#1",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\Gamma=\\frac{\\varphi_1}{\\varphi}$ （6.21）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0214#2",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为此我们把对于 $\\varphi_1$ 和 $\\varphi_2$ 的等式代入上式：",
        "$\\Gamma=\\frac{h/F}{h/d_0}=\\frac{d_0}{F}$ （6.22）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0214#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "移动物体使之比焦平面更近，这时的放大率比物体位于",
        "焦平面上时增加不大，但这样眼睛就紧张了."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0214#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**显微镜**　放大镜的放大率是有限的，因为直径小的透镜",
        "才有很小的焦距，而用这种透镜是很困难的. 大的放大率需",
        "要再用一个透镜来获得. 这个透镜叫做**物镜**. 物镜给出物体",
        "的放大实像，然后再用叫做**目镜**的放大镜来观察这个实像，这",
        "样组合的光学仪器叫做**显微镜**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0214#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了获得物体放大的实像，把物体放在物镜焦点和两倍",
        "焦距的点之间，用目镜观察时，需把目镜这样安置，使物镜所",
        "成的像在目镜的焦平面上. 这样从目镜中观察时眼睛就不紧"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0214#6",
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 190",
      "box": [
